    <span>Round <span class="hl" id="roundNum">1</span></span>
    <span>Your last pick: <span class="hl" id="lastYourPick">—</span></span>
    <span id="clockMsgWaiting">Picks until you're on the clock: <span class="hl" id="untilClock">1</span></span>
