</div>

<div id="backupPanel" style="display:none; margin:0 14px 10px; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--amber); border-radius:10px; padding:12px;">
  <div style="font-size:12px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:8px;">Your backup code — tap the box, select all, copy:</div>
  <textarea id="backupText" readonly style="width:100%; height:70px; background:var(--surface2); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; color:var(--text); font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; padding:8px; resize:none;"></textarea>
  <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:8px;">
    <button class="toggle-btn" id="backupCopyBtn" style="flex:1;">Try auto-copy</button>
    <button class="toggle-btn" id="backupCloseBtn" style="flex:1;">Done</button>
  </div>
  <div id="backupCopyMsg" style="font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:6px;"></div>
</div>

<div id="restorePanel" style="display:none; margin:0 14px 10px; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; padding:12px;">
  <div style="font-size:12px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:8px;">Paste your backup code below:</div>
  <textarea id="restoreText" placeholder="Paste here…" style="width:100%; height:70px; background:var(--surface2); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; color:var(--text); font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; padding:8px; resize:none;"></textarea>
  <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:8px;">
    <button class="toggle-btn" id="restoreLoadBtn" style="flex:1; background:var(--mine); color:#0A0E1A; border-color:var(--mine);">Load picks</button>
    <button class="toggle-btn" id="restoreCloseBtn" style="flex:1;">Cancel</button>
  </div>
  <div id="restoreMsg" style="font-size:11px; margin-top:6px;"></div>
</div>

<div id="resetConfirmPanel" style="display:none; margin:0 14px 10px; background:#2a1414; border:1px solid #5A2323; border-radius:10px; padding:12px;">
  <div style="font-size:12px; color:#FF8A8A; margin-bottom:8px;">Reset all tracked picks? This can't be undone — back up first if unsure.</div>
  <div style="display:flex; gap:8px;">
    <button class="toggle-btn" id="resetConfirmYes" style="flex:1; background:#FF8A8A; color:#2a1414; border-color:#FF8A8A;">Yes, reset everything</button>
    <button class="toggle-btn" id="resetConfirmNo" style="flex:1;">Cancel</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="roster-panel" id="rosterPanel">
  <h2>Your Lineup Preview</h2>
  <div id="slotList"></div>
  <div style="margin-top:8px; font-size:11px; color:var(--muted);">Auto-fills required slots first, then WRT flex, then WR/TE/QB flex, then bench — matches your league's roster shape.</div>
</div>

<div class="section-note">Tap a player to cycle: <b style="color:var(--text)">available → drafted by you → drafted by other</b>. Tap again to reset. Auto-save is best-effort — use <b>Backup picks</b> every few rounds so you're never relying on it alone.</div>

<div class="list" id="list"></div>

<div class="footer-note">
  Rankings baseline: consensus PPR ADP as of ~July 8–30, 2026 (SI/FantasyPros/CBS). Adjusted for your half-PPR + yardage-bonus + turnover-penalty scoring — treat as a strong starting order, not gospel. HOLD-IN and INJURY flags reflect news as of July 30, 2026 — re-check live news morning-of if anything's changed.
  <br><br>
